  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "PRIVATE BEACH<br>PET FRIENDLY (Dogs only with approval)<br><br>COME SEE OUR IMPROVEMENTS!<br><br>Suite 16 is a slice of Heaven on earth. You can enjoy sugar white sands and emerald waters by day and the calming sounds of the surf by night. There is a private deck off the spacious living area, as well as a private balcony off the master bedroom. <br><br>The air conditioner has been replaced in 2023 so we should not have those a/c issues mentioned in reviews. Improvements have been made throughout!<br><br>King in master bedroom furniture and linens, guest room has 2 brand new full beds with comfy bedding. Come see our improvements! We supply beach chairs, umbrellas and beach toys so less for you to pack! <br><br>The views are breathtaking in all directions and are often called the best on the beach. Cozy living room, new kitchen appliances, spacious bedrooms, washer/dryer, covered parking and more. This is a wonderful vacation retreat... enjoy the serenity of our beach in Seagrove. <br><br>Walton Dunes is a non-smoking property in its' entirety, please respect the Associations' rules. <br><br>Only Walton County, FL landowners are allowed to have pets on the beach with proper permits.<br><br>Our a/c units have been serviced so it does get cooler on the 3rd floor, however, this is still Florida in the summer.<br><br>Golf carts are not allowed on Walton Dunes property.<br><br><br>Keywords: Townhome",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "NOW BOOKING FOR SPRING BREAK and SUMMER. DOG FRIENDLY WITH PET FEE."
        }
      ],
